// notebook.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/notebook/notebook.cpp
//
// The wxWidgets "book controls" sample: one frame that hosts a wxNotebook,
// wxListbook, wxChoicebook, wxTreebook, wxToolbook, wxAuiNotebook or
// wxSimplebook, recreated on demand from the File/Pages/Operations menus, with
// a read-only log window above the book control.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\notebook\notebook.kwxts
//
// Differences from the C++ original, forced by the binding (see the final
// report for details):
//   * SetIcon(wxICON(sample)) loads the sample's sample.xpm file at run time
//     instead of using the icon resource compiled into the C++ executable;
//   * the GTK-only GTKAllowDiagnosticsControl() call is guarded by a run-time
//     platform check instead of #ifdef __WXGTK__.

